  "body": "It would be useful to have some or all of the [`img` processing model](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/images.html#images-processing-model) available for re-use by other types of image loads, e.g., background-images, or even fetches whose `destination` is `\"image\"`.\r\n\r\nSee also: #4793, and discussion around [PR#5112](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5112#issuecomment-578134121)",
